#: openedx/core/djangoapps/notifications/admin.py:71
msgid ""
"Search by username, course_id. Specify fields with username: or course_id: prefixes. If no prefix is specified, search will be done on username. \n"
"Examples: \n"
" - testuser (default username search) \n"
" - username:testuser (username keyword search) \n"
" - course_id:course-v1:edX+DemoX+Demo_Course (course_id keyword search) \n"
" - username:testuser, course_id:course-v1:edX+DemoX+Demo_Course (combined keyword search) \n"
msgstr ""
"Tafuta kwa kutumia jina la mtumiaji, course_id. Tambua sehemu kwa kutumia viambatisho vya username: au course_id:. Ikiwa hakuna viambatisho, utafanya utafutaji kwa jina la mtumiaji.\n"
"Mfano:\n"
" - testuser (tafutaji ya jina la mtumiaji ya asili)\n"
" - username:testuser (tafutaji ya neno muhimu la jina la mtumiaji)\n"
" - course_id:course-v1:edX+DemoX+Demo_Course (tafutaji ya neno muhimu la course_id)\n"
" - username:testuser, course_id:course-v1:edX+DemoX+Demo_Course (tafutaji ya maneno muhimu ya pamoja)\n"

