msgstr ""
"Ikiwa imewekwa, yaliyomo ya mlolongo yatafichwa kwa watumiaji wasio wa "
"wafanyakazi baada ya tarehe ya kukabidhi kupita."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:99
msgid "Is Entrance Exam"
msgstr "Je, Ni Mtihani wa Kuingia"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:101
msgid ""
"Tag this course block as an Entrance Exam. Note, you must enable Entrance "
"Exams for this course setting to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Weka lebo kwenye kipande cha kozi hiki kama Mtihani wa Kuingia. Kumbuka, "
"lazima uwezeshe Mtihani wa Kuingia ili mpangilio huu ufanye kazi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:152
msgid "Is Time Limited"
msgstr "Je, Ina Kipimo cha Muda"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:154
msgid ""
"This setting indicates whether students have a limited time to view or "
"interact with this courseware component."
msgstr ""
"Mpangilio huu unaonyesha ikiwa wanafunzi wana muda uliopunguzwa wa kuangalia"
" au kuingiliana na kipengele hiki cha vifaa vya kozi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:162
msgid "Time Limit in Minutes"
msgstr "Kipimo cha Muda kwa Dakika"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:164
msgid ""
"The number of minutes available to students for viewing or interacting with "
"this courseware component."
msgstr ""
"Idadi ya dakika zinazopatikana kwa wanafunzi kuangalia au kuingiliana na "
"kipengele hiki cha vifaa vya kozi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:171
msgid "Is Proctoring Enabled"
msgstr "Je, Udhibiti wa Mtihani umewezeshwa"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:173
msgid "This setting indicates whether this exam is a proctored exam."
msgstr "Mpangilio huu unaonyesha ikiwa mtihani huu ni mtihani unaodhibitiwa."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:180
msgid "Software Secure Review Rules"
msgstr "Kanuni za Ukaguzi Salama wa Programu"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:182
msgid ""
"This setting indicates what rules the proctoring team should follow when "
"viewing the videos."
msgstr ""
"Mpangilio huu unaonyesha kanuni gani timu ya udhibiti inapaswa kufuata "
"wakati wa kuangalia video."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:189
msgid "Is Practice Exam"
msgstr "Je, Ni Mtihani wa Mazoezi"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:191
msgid ""
"This setting indicates whether this exam is for testing purposes only. "
"Practice exams are not verified."
msgstr ""
"Mpangilio huu unaonyesha ikiwa mtihani huu ni kwa ajili ya majaribio tu. "
"Mtihani wa mazoezi hauhakikishiwi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:198
msgid "Is Onboarding Exam"
msgstr "Je, Ni Mtihani wa Kuanzisha"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:200
