msgstr "Viambatisho vya Wiki"

#: wiki/forms.py:31
msgid "Only localhost... muahahaha"
msgstr "Ni localhost tu... muahahaha"

#: wiki/forms.py:37
msgid "Initial title of the article. May be overridden with revision titles."
msgstr ""
"Kichwa cha awali cha makala. Inaweza kubadilishwa na vichwa vya maboresho."

#: wiki/forms.py:38
msgid "Type in some contents"
msgstr "Andika baadhi ya maudhui"

#: wiki/forms.py:39
msgid ""
"This is just the initial contents of your article. After creating it, you "
"can use more complex features like adding plugins, meta data, related "
"articles etc..."
msgstr ""
"Haya ni maudhui ya awali tu ya makala yako. Baada ya kuunda, unaweza kutumia"
" vipengele tata kama kuongeza plugins, metadata, makala zinazohusiana n.k."

#: wiki/forms.py:46 wiki/forms.py:209
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "Maudhui"

#: wiki/forms.py:49 wiki/forms.py:212
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Muhtasari"

#: wiki/forms.py:49
msgid ""
"Give a short reason for your edit, which will be stated in the revision log."
msgstr ""
"Toa sababu fupi ya uhariri wako, ambayo itaorodheshwa kwenye kumbukumbu ya "
"maboresho."

#: wiki/forms.py:98
msgid ""
"While you were editing, someone else changed the revision. Your contents "
"have been automatically merged with the new contents. Please review the text"
" below."
msgstr ""
"Wakati ulikuwa ukihariri, mtu mwingine alibadilisha toleo. Maudhui yako "
"yameunganishwa moja kwa moja na maudhui mapya. Tafadhali angalia maandishi "
"hapa chini."

#: wiki/forms.py:100
msgid "No changes made. Nothing to save."
msgstr "Hakuna mabadiliko yaliyofanywa. Hakuna kinachohifadhiwa."

#: wiki/forms.py:207 wiki/templates/wiki/dir.html:55
msgid "Slug"
msgstr "Slug"

#: wiki/forms.py:207
msgid ""
"This will be the address where your article can be found. Use only "
"alphanumeric characters and - or _. Note that you cannot change the slug "
"after creating the article."
msgstr ""
"Hii itakuwa anwani ambapo makala yako itapatikana. Tumia herufi na nambari "
"pekee pamoja na - au _. Kumbuka kuwa huwezi kubadilisha slug baada ya kuunda"
" makala."

#: wiki/forms.py:212
msgid "Write a brief message for the article's history log."
msgstr "Andika ujumbe mfupi kwa kumbukumbu ya historia ya makala."

#: wiki/forms.py:222
