#: wiki/forms.py:249
msgid ""
"Purge the article: Completely remove it (and all its contents) with no undo."
" Purging is a good idea if you want to free the slug such that users can "
"create new articles in its place."
msgstr ""
"Safisha makala: Iondoe kabisa (na maudhui yote) bila uwezo wa kurudisha. "
"Kutoa makala ni wazo zuri ikiwa unataka kuondoa slug ili watumiaji waweze "
"kuunda makala mpya badala yake."

