msgid ""
"For the specified problem, permanently and completely delete the learner's "
"answers and scores from the database."
msgstr ""
"Kwa tatizo lililotolewa, futa miojawapo na alama za mwanafunzi kabisa na "
"milele kutoka kwenye hifadhidata."

